  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: collegequest2NORMALROUTE
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri reaches down to pick the amulet back up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As she does so, she notices that the wall the amulet came from seems
      to be radiating something... faint and magical.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792054
    - rid: 4351267964947792056
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri lets go of the amulet, letting it drop to floor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. That wall seems to react in some way whenever we touch the amulet.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri reaches down again, this time putting the amulet around her neck.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792057
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: What was once a faint radiation grows to be visibly noticeable.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792058
    - rid: 4351267964947792059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Some kind of resonance... you and the wall.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: It must be connected to the amulet!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792060
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I wonder... what effect might your spells might have?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: My spells, hm?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792062
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri summons her bound dagger and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792063
    - rid: 4972360475574796409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: -stabs the wall. Shattering it, revealing a way forward and lowering
      the passageway's obstruction.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792065
    - rid: 4351267964947792066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure what to expect here, be on your guard...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792070
    - rid: 4351267964947792071
    - rid: 4351267964947792072
    - rid: 4351267964947792074
    - rid: 4351267964947792075
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
